  "slug": "5-can-potato-soup-recipe-11892210",
  "name": "5 Can Potato Soup",
  "recipe_type": "soup",
  "brief_description": "This 5 can potato soup is my go-to when I want comfort without the effort. Creamy, cheesy, and satisfying, it delivers all the flavor of a loaded baked potato with almost zero prep. Garnish with chives, bacon, and more Cheddar if you want to take it over the top.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Whisk chicken broth, evaporated milk, Cheddar cheese soup, and cream of chicken soup together in a saucepan over medium heat until well blended. Add diced potatoes; cook until hot, 5 to 10 minutes."
    }
  ],
